# Wayland compositors don't let a client activate an already-mapped window
# without an activation token from user input, so BaseWindow::Activate() can't
# switch between two shown browser windows. See crbug.com/483363917 for context.
-GlobalBrowserCollectionTest.TestObservationWithSingleProfile
